[22.444909, "o", "**Tests run: 13 — all green.** Ground truth confirmed.\r\n\r\nLet me show the classic smell in `GildedRose.java`: `updateQuality()` is an if/else ladder over three name constants (`AGED_BRIE`, `BACKSTAGE_PASS`, `SULFURAS`) dispatching to one private `updateX(Item)` helper per item type.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.445359, "o", "\u001b[0m→ \u001b[0mRead src/main/java/gildedrose/GildedRose.java\r\n"]
[25.103067, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m# \u001b[0mTodos\r\n[✓] M0: Run mvn test — ground truth (13 tests green)\r\n[•] M1: EXPAND — create ItemUpdater interface + 4 rule shells, mvn test green\r\n[ ] M2a: MIGRATE AgedBrie — move updateAgedBrie, rename->update, rewire, mvn test green\r\n[ ] M2b: MIGRATE BackstagePass — move updateBackstagePass, rename->update, rewire, mvn test green\r\n[ ] M2c: MIGRATE Sulfuras — move updateSulfuras, rename->update, rewire, mvn test green\r\n[ ] M2d: MIGRATE Regular — move updateNormal, rename->update, rewire, mvn test green\r\n"]
[25.10321, "o", "[ ] M3: CONTRACT — chain iteration, drop dead helpers + name constants, mvn test green\r\n[ ] Epilogue: trace an item through the chain, report 13 green\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.120338, "o", "The classic smell: `updateQuality()` is an if/else ladder over name constants, each branch calling a private helper — a strategy pattern just waiting to be extracted. Milestone 0 complete.\r\n"]
