[28.484834, "o", "## Milestone 1 — EXPAND\r\n\r\n**Audience:** I'm creating the strategy abstraction *alongside* the legacy code — `GildedRose.java` stays untouched. Five new files, so I'm writing them directly: the `ItemUpdater` interface plus four abstract rule shells that only know which items they match.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.604595, "o", "**Audience:** the abstraction now exists in parallel — each rule is an abstract shell that compiles (its `update` is unimplemented) but knows which items it handles; `RegularUpdater` is the always-true fallback tail. Verifying nothing broke:\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
